{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411430","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411430","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1241143001:1":{"text":"ソニアさん、死海の艦隊も倒しましたし、ラスティーアンカーが穏やかになった後はどうするつもりですか？","source_cn":"索尼娅，击败死潮舰队，锈锚港恢复平静之后，你有什么计划呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E6E8F4F741BA85D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241143002:1":{"text":"あっ、別に何か探ろうとしているわけじゃないですよ！ただ、すべてが落ち着いたら、ラスティーアンカーはどうなるのかなと思って。","source_cn":"我不是想打探血薇帮的机密！只是有点好奇，当一切恢复平静...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0DA81E85B15FA08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241143003:1":{"text":"……今回の封鎖でだいぶ痛手を負ってしまったからな。まずは街の貿易を復興させ、暮らしの安定に努めるつもりだ。","source_cn":"……锈锚港在这次封锁中元气大伤，我会着手恢复锈锚港的贸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED5BDEA910143DE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241143004:1":{"text":"「血気盛んな」風習は……？","source_cn":"那么锈锚港的民风问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6608C6A31480EF63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241143005:1":{"text":"それは我々の生き方だ。","source_cn":"那是我们的生活方式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC459146F3B3BB546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241143006:1":{"text":"それに、昔と比べたらだいぶマシになったのだぞ。","source_cn":"而且，现在比起之前，已经好了太多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27777192223292B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241143007:1":{"text":"昔、ここには大勢の孤児がいた。","source_cn":"很久以前，这里有很多孤儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF644CDFE73734FE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241143008:1":{"text":"商人や旅人が頻繁に往来し、近海では海賊が暴れ、酒の貿易が盛んで、宿屋は夜通し繁盛していた。","source_cn":"因为来往的商旅很多，附近海盗猖獗，酒水生意红火，旅馆的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE53D0524E38C3AD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241143009:1":{"text":"あの時は名前も家もない子どもが数え切れないほどいたんだ。","source_cn":"那时候，没有名字的孤儿像海边石头一样多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A72A975E1AEAEEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241143010:1":{"text":"道を歩けば、様々な死に方をした死体がゴロゴロ転がっていた。","source_cn":"走在路上，每天都能发现各种死状的尸体。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8ADF95C0B522475","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241143011:1":{"text":"な、なんて恐ろしい！","source_cn":"这、这也太可怕了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26358A08482EADFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241143012:1":{"text":"あたしとナーラは、そういう環境で育った孤児だ。","source_cn":"我和奈拉就是在那种环境下长大的孤儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD099363EC8DB2C86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241143013:1":{"text":"最初は、血の繋がっていないナーラを、ただの足手まといにしか思っていなかった。","source_cn":"她不是我的亲妹妹，我本来也不想带着一个累赘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFE72070580B084D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241143014:1":{"text":"だが……あの子は振り払っても振り払ってもついてきた。あたしが折れるまでな。","source_cn":"但……她像个甩不掉的尾巴。直到我再也不想甩下她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE941185B558452A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1241143015:1":{"text":"あの頃のナーラさんは、とても可愛かったでしょうね。","source_cn":"那时候的奈拉，一定很可爱吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10C6D3C7431764FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241143016:1":{"text":".……分かりました。","source_cn":"……是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E0328B18230A536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1241143016":{"text":".……分かりました。","source_cn":"……是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E0328B18230A536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241143017:1":{"text":"大丈夫だ。あの子はそう簡単には死なない。","source_cn":"没关系。我相信她不会轻易死去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x798F07E8D9F6229E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241143018:1":{"text":"あんたたちも聞いただろ？たとえ海の底に沈んでも、必ず這い戻ってくると……","source_cn":"你没听到她说的吗？就算沉入海底，她都要爬回来找我……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x115DD3390C997FA0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あんたたちも聞いただろ？たとえ海の底に沈んでも、必ず這い戻ってくると……","female":"あんたたちも聞いただろ？たとえ海の底に沈んでも、必ず這い戻ってくると……","variant_male_record_index":"136377","variant_female_record_index":"136378","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241143019:1":{"text":"ソニアさん……","source_cn":"索尼娅……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE6FBB2BA2BF986B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1241143020:1":{"text":"あの子はきっと帰って来る。","source_cn":"我相信她会回来的，我就在这等着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AA6F1539BD4766A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1241143021:1":{"text":"どれぐらい経とうとも、あたしはここで待ち続ける。","source_cn":"无论要等多久，我都会等她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE0356EFB0E7555E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1241143022:1":{"text":"それまでに、ラスティーアンカーの問題を解決しておかないとな。","source_cn":"在那之前，我必须把锈锚港的事情处理好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2397DFE13FF1912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1241143023:1":{"text":"二度と、あたしたちのような悲惨な運命を辿る子どもを生みだしてはならない。","source_cn":"我不允许这里再出现命运和我们一样悲惨的孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D934D33847459E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1241143024:1":{"text":"だからあたしは、ラスティーアンカーを統べると決意したのだ。","source_cn":"这也是我决心管理锈锚港的初衷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF21F3AED4C262B62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"悲しいことを思い出させてしまったな。","source_cn":"勾起了你的伤心事","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF41E636677C1E6BE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"悲しいことを思い出させてしまったな。","female":"悲しいことを思い出させてしまったわね。","variant_male_record_index":"66618","variant_female_record_index":"66619","document_title":"","document_title_mal